# Timiva QA Rules

## Purpose

These rules define the required quality checks before commit or deploy.

## Required checks

Before commit or deploy, Cursor must check:

```text
npm run build
Home Page
All Tools Page
Completed tool pages
Privacy Policy
Terms of Use
Contact
English routes
Traditional Chinese routes
Mobile portrait
Mobile landscape
Desktop
Header
Footer
Console errors
```

## Tool page QA

Each tool page must pass:

```text
Main function works
Default state works
Empty state works
Invalid input does not crash
Mobile portrait works
Mobile landscape works
Desktop works
FAQ / SEO is valid
Related Tools links are correct
Header / Footer are intact
```

## Tailwind / HTML QA

Check:

```text
No inline style
No !important
No CSS id selector
Semantic HTML
Chinese comments for major sections
RWD organized by component
```

## Locked components

If locked components were modified without Owner approval, block the task.

Locked components:

```text
Header
Footer
Base Layout
Global background
Shared container
```

## Phase A rule

During Phase A, passing QA does not mean automatic commit or deploy.

Cursor must wait for Owner Final Approval.
